---
title: Deck - what the agent decides, and what it does not
---
flowchart TB
    Ask([Explicit presentation request]) --> Supervisor[Typed supervisor route]
    Supervisor --> Job[(Durable owned job)]
    Job --> Worker[Leased background worker]

    Worker --> Research[One grounded search<br/>subject, not the brief]
    Research --> Outline[Model plans the outline<br/>and each slide's shape]
    Outline --> Slide[Model writes one slide at a time]

    Slide --> Compile[Deterministic compiler<br/>geometry - seven layouts - stable ids]
    Compile --> Visual{Worth an image?}
    Visual -->|bounded, best effort| Image[FLUX.2 Klein via ComfyUI]
    Visual -->|no| Render
    Image --> Render[PptxGenJS - OOXML - LibreOffice]
    Render --> Revision[(Append-only revision)]

    Decides[The model decides content and shape.<br/>Geometry, storage and promotion<br/>are application decisions]
    Decides -.-> Outline
    Decides -.-> Slide

    Boundary[A figure the sources do not support<br/>must become a plainer layout]
    Boundary -.-> Research

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    classDef warning fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class Ask interface;
    class Supervisor,Worker,Compile,Visual,Render,Research application;
    class Job,Revision data;
    class Image external;
    class Outline,Slide data;
    class Decides,Boundary warning;
